description	"Old Republic Officer 

Resilient Customizable Hybrid Leaders with specialized weaponry and dueling skills who can give a morale boost.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Vibrosaber
-- Saber Defense (0)
-- No Blaster Block
-- 15% faster Movement
> Vibrosword (Yellow/Red/Blue)
-- 5% less Reach
> Vibrostaff (Staff)
-- 19% more Reach
- Old Republic Blaster Pistol (1)
-- Mag Reload
-- 15% faster Movement
-- 30% more Damage
-- 40% less RoF
-- Alt Fire Disabled
-- Less Clip size

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (3)
- Rally
- Dexterity (1)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]"
- Pep Talk (Resource Dispenser 1)
- Medpac ^3[CS4]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS2]
